0.20 0.45 0.72 RG 0.8 w 58 656 m 554 656 l S
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 0.08 0.14 0.22 rg 58 634 Td (1. Executive Summary) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.20 rg 58 616 Td (FRAMS \(Face Recognition Attendance & Access Management System\) is a FastAPI + React single-page application) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.20 rg 58 603 Td (fronted by nginx. A comprehensive black-box security assessment was performed using the owner-supplied) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.20 rg 58 590 Td (administrator account and purpose-created low-privilege accounts. The application was tested for authentication and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.20 rg 58 577 Td (session weaknesses, authorization and privilege escalation, injection, information disclosure, malformed-input) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.20 rg 58 564 Td (handling, brute-force protection, export/data handling, and biometric data exposure.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.2 Tf 0.08 0.14 0.22 rg 58 546 Td (Overall result:) Tj /F1 9.2 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.20 rg 64 0 Td (no Critical or High severity vulnerabilities were identified. The application demonstrates strong,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.20 rg 58 533 Td (defense-in-depth security: server-side role-based authorization on every sensitive endpoint, one-active-session with) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.2 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.20 rg 58 520 Td (instant server-side revocation, wrapper-encrypted login credentials \(RSA-3072 / AES-256-GCM\), strict input validation) Tj ET
